                <pb facs="0447" n="341" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg341"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Rockhill to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-07-30"><hi rendition="#italic">July 30,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Rockhill reports that the British and French Governments did not ask
                    exemplary damages on account of Nanchang riots.)</p>
            </div>
